Budgetoid/Infrastructure/bin/
Budgetoid/Infrastructure/obj/
ClientApp/Elm/elm-stuff/
ClientApp/Elm/public/
BudgetoidApp/Application/obj/
BudgetoidApp/Application/bin/
BudgetoidApp/Application/obj/
BudgetoidApp/Domain/obj/
BudgetoidApp/Domain/bin/
BudgetoidApp/Infrastructure/obj/
